title: Asked to, a line longer than its card goes on in the rows under it: the card grows, a click and typing on a wrapped row land on the column aimed at, Down goes to the next row, and turned off the line is cut again
folders: long-lines
prefs: {"wrap": true}
expect-file: long-lines/src/table.rs :: (?m)^.{199,200}ON_A_WRAPPED_ROW
expect-file: long-lines/src/table.rs :: (?m)^    vec!\[.*ON_A_WRAPPED_ROW.+DOWN.*// end of the pairs$
expect-file: long-lines/src/table.rs :: (?m)^.{500,501}DEEPER
forbid-log: the rest of line (1|2|3|4|5|7|9|10|11|12) of
expect-log: the rest of line 6 of src/table\.rs is shown over its card
expect-log: the rest of line 8 of src/table\.rs is shown
expect-file: {WORK}/data/prefs.json :: "wrap": false

resize 1600 1000
wait 3000
goto src/table.rs
wait 1500
zoom 0.8
wait 1200
mark wrapped
wait 500
zoom 0.4
wait 1000
mark wrapped-tokens
wait 500
zoom 0.5
wait 1000
mark wrapped-lines
wait 500
zoom 5
wait 1200
hover src/table.rs 3 175
wait 700
mark no-rest-beside
wait 500
tool edit
wait 300
zoom 1.1
wait 1200
click src/table.rs 3 200
wait 600
type ON_A_WRAPPED_ROW
wait 600
key down
wait 300
type DOWN
wait 800
mark typed-on-a-row
wait 500
find WRAPPED_ROW
wait 800
mark found-on-a-row
wait 500
find close
wait 300
click src/table.rs 6 501
wait 600
type DEEPER
wait 800
mark typed-deeper
wait 500
key save
wait 800
left settings:Wrap long lines
wait 1200
mark settings
wait 500
ui click 541 256
wait 800
mark settings-off
wait 500
left settings:close
wait 1200
mark cut-again
wait 500
key escape
wait 300
hover src/table.rs 8 20
wait 900
mark rest-beside-again
wait 500
quit
